  "scope": "Rebuilds the I/R/P/T/C/H marks from each card's receipt and compares them with the document. It checks that a printed ○ has receipt evidence behind it and that no receipt hides a stage the document leaves blank. The predicates are conservative heuristics over field names: they can confirm a mark is backed, and they can catch a mark with no backing field, but they do not judge whether the evidence means what the stage requires."
